                <h4
                  class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-wood-accent transition-colors"
                >
                  RFID IoT Membership Scanner & Automation Integration
                </h4>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-2 mb-3">
                  <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-gray-150 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 rounded text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide">ESP32 (C++)</span>
                  <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-gray-150 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 rounded text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide">n8n</span>
                  <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-gray-150 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 rounded text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide">Supabase</span>
                  <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-gray-150 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 rounded text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide">Telegram API</span>
                  <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-gray-150 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 rounded text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide">LittleFS</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-wood-accent mt-1 italic">
                  Pain Fixed: Slow check-in queues, lost paper logs, and manual membership database tracking.
                </p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                  Engineered a complete RFID check-in validation system combining an ESP32 microchip, Supabase backend databases, and real-time n8n cloud Telegram alerts. Features LittleFS offline queue support to prevent scan loss.
                </p>
              </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Project: Local-First School Attendance Management System -->
            <div
              class="project-card group"
              data-aos="fade-up"
              data-category="fullstack iot"
            >
              <div
                class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl shadow-lg aspect-video bg-gray-200 flex flex-col justify-end"
              >
                <!-- Hardware Prototype Image -->
                <img
                  src="../assets/school-attendance-system/prototype.jpg"
                  alt="Local-First School Attendance Management System Prototype"
                  class="absolute inset-0 object-cover w-full h-full transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
