                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a href="/quick-portfolio/portfolio/attendance-management-system-school/" class="block mt-4">
                <h4
                  class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-wood-accent transition-colors"
                >
                  Local-First School Attendance Management System
                </h4>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mt-2 mb-3">
                  <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-gray-150 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 rounded text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide">ESP32 (C++)</span>
                  <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-gray-150 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 rounded text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide">Express.js</span>
                  <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-gray-150 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 rounded text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide">Better-SQLite3</span>
                  <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-gray-150 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 rounded text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide">JWT Auth</span>
                  <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-gray-150 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300 rounded text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wide">OLED & Buzzer</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-wood-accent mt-1 italic">
                  Pain Fixed: Hardware scanner failure during cloud outages and high API sync latencies.
